{"overview":"مسافرانی که به دنبال شب‌های رمانتیک بر روی یک کشتی زیبا به سمت کشورهای گرمسیری یا مرموز می‌گردند، تصمیم می‌گیرند تعطیلات خود را در «کشتی عشق» بگذرانند، جایی که گوفر، دکتر بریکِر، ایزاک، جولی و کاپیتان استوبینگ تمام تلاش خود را می‌کنند تا آن‌ها را راضی کنند و گاهی هم به آن‌ها کمک می‌کنند عاشق شوند. اوضاع همیشه آسان نیست، اما در نهایت عشق پیروز می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Passengers who search for romantic nights aboard a beautiful ship travelling to tropical or mysterious countries, decide to pass their vacation aboard the \"Love Boat\", where Gopher, Dr. Bricker, Isaac, Julie, and Captain Stubing try their best to please them, and sometimes help them fall in love. Things are not always so easy, but in the end, love wins.","tagline_en":"You Say You Can't Score on Shore? On This Cruise... You Can't Lose!","runtime":48,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":25,"y":1977,"poster":"/ldNFxSrr7ZHUcxYeOBkFB7KvDkC.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":27,"y":1978,"poster":"/kAj3SEAdDc6EWNfShaJKkTGtL1T.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":28,"y":1979,"poster":"/dkQefOtIoJAm8EwaOE0V2xXAvfT.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":28,"y":1980,"poster":"/8al17NBZLGvtUYlfQpevHyGjGgE.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":31,"y":1981,"poster":"/bJJlDrGcg5id0JueYFBkGDdlSVJ.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":29,"y":1982,"poster":"/i2O4uYWN7lw9b9kdJa59wKRkQo1.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":27,"y":1983,"poster":"/bMyc4UeVi6CUUYOYZJ39vRBuLuB.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":27,"y":1984,"poster":"/5G4J0U3CdK5YUsXEabT1mIH4ay.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":25,"y":1985,"poster":"/49QAxIod7uN5Ee5ynUvlRC0Kt2X.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":4,"y":1986,"poster":"/v1RfXQxfDKWOuL4lMg6upggUdTz.jpg"}],"episodes":251,"crew":["Aaron Spelling","Wilford Lloyd Baumes"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Gavin MacLeod","role":"Merril Stubing","photo":"/ESyFJ9IR7vfaf0YdmYsFiI1JUv.jpg"},{"name":"Bernie Kopell","role":"Adam Bricker","photo":"/Au0u38066KHUigrBmYUBLmIDWDl.jp